---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Enterprise Case Studies | High-Touch Solution Architecture | TAMS"
  description="Explore technical blueprints and strategic outcomes delivered by Lee Gorse, featuring major migrations, stack consolidations, and revenue engines for enterprise clients."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-[#F4F7F6] text-[#1A1A1B] font-sans antialiased relative overflow-hidden">
    
    <!-- Technical Blueprint Grid Background Overlay -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03] bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#1A1A1B_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#1A1A1B_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:10px_10px]"></div>

    <!-- Page Header Block -->
    <header class="relative border-b-2 border-[#1A1A1B] bg-white py-16 md:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center md:text-left">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E31B23] font-semibold">Architectural Proof Points</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1A1A1B] mt-3">
          Case Studies & System Blueprints
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          I don't configure platforms on the fly. I architect systems. These narratives outline the strategic design, technical blueprints, and governance structures I have deployed for tier-one brands.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Case Studies Listing Section -->
    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- CARD 1: NEW - HEALTHCARE MAP MIGRATION -->
        <article class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-sm hover:border-[#E31B23] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow">
          <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-[#004D40] text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm">AWS / Eloqua / SFMC</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">July 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A1B] hover:text-[#004D40] transition-colors leading-snug">
              <a href="/case-studies/healthcare-map-migration">Enterprise MAP-to-MAP Migration & Data Architecture</a>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">
              CLIENT: Major US-based Healthcare Insurer (HK B2B Business Unit)
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Consolidating duplicate tier-one marketing stacks (SFMC to Eloqua) and integrating AWS Data Lakes and CRM into a unified relational database layout.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#004D40]">Strategic Architecture</span>
            <a href="/case-studies/healthcare-map-migration" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#E31B23] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              View Blueprint →
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CARD 2: VMO2 REVENUE ENGINE -->
        <article class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-sm hover:border-[#E31B23] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow">
          <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-[#004D40] text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm">RevUp / SFDC / Eloqua</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">Case Study</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A1B] hover:text-[#004D40] transition-colors leading-snug">
              <a href="/case-studies/vmo2-revenue-engine">UK Telco Revenue Engine Transformation</a>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">
              CLIENT: A major UK-based Telco
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Designing scalable lead-to-opportunity routing engines, technical SLAs, and CRM syncing governance to eliminate marketing leakage across complex commercial entities.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#004D40]">Revenue Engine</span>
            <a href="/case-studies/vmo2-revenue-engine" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#E31B23] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              View Blueprint →
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CARD 3: SPARK TRANSFORMATION -->
        <article class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-sm hover:border-[#E31B23] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow">
          <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-[#004D40] text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm">Eloqua/PEGA</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">Case Study</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A1B] hover:text-[#004D40] transition-colors leading-snug">
              <a href="/case-studies/spark-transformation">Platform Optimisation & Operational Redesign</a>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">
              CLIENT: A Global Telco with multple operating company subsidiaries 
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Rescuing under-utilised automation investments, aligning core data integrations, and delivering a comprehensive technical operating model for regional B2B entities.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#004D40]">Governance Blueprint</span>
            <a href="/case-studies/spark-transformation" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#E31B23] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              View Blueprint →
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Bottom Advisory Panel -->
    <section class="bg-white border-t-2 border-[#1A1A1B] py-16">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E31B23] font-bold">Engagement Options</h3>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#1A1A1B]">How I Deliver Value to Enterprise Teams</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
          I operate as a pure white-label technical architect for premier agencies, or a high-touch trusted advisor for enterprise martech governance.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
          <a href="/partnerships" class="px-8 py-3 bg-[#004D40] hover:bg-[#003c32] text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-sm transition-all shadow-md">
            Review Strategic Partnership Model
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>